sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as FastAPI /v1/auth
    participant WS as WebSocket /v1/ws
    participant BUS as MemoryBus
    participant DB as SQLite

    FE->>API: POST /login (email, pw)
    API->>DB: bcrypt verify
    DB-->>API: user
    API-->>FE: JWT (access + refresh)

    FE->>WS: upgrade ws + Bearer JWT
    WS->>WS: verify JWT
    WS->>BUS: subscribe horizon.portfolio.* + horizon.order.fill.*

    par live push
        BUS-->>WS: PORTFOLIO_UPDATE
        WS-->>FE: {nav, cash, positions}
    and
        BUS-->>WS: ORDER_FILL
        WS-->>FE: {fill_id, symbol, qty, price}
    end

    FE->>FE: Zustand store update
    FE->>FE: re-render NAV/blotter
